			"height": 188,
			"color": "5",
			"label": "Phase 3 · Safety"
		},
		{
			"id": "t3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 1 · [[Mine the corpus with the SLM]]\nThe fine-tuned extractor (held-out word F1 0.785, same field search as DeepSeek: 38 / 66 / 80) over all 512k documents; import and embed the fields. ≈ $9–13, Vast top-up first.\n**Unblocks:** field search over the whole corpus for the final evaluation.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 74,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 268,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "title",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Roadmap\n⬇ in order. The corpus is mined with the SLM (23 Nov). Now: import and embed the fields, then the final evaluation (one card with a checklist).",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "t2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 3 · [[Rewrite the query from the chat history]]\nOne standalone query from the conversation before the first search; ask_user replies become filters (source, channel, team).\n**Done when:** multi-turn questions score like single questions.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 838,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 268
		},
		{
			"id": "a2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "[[Article - problems by metric and how to fix them]]\nSymptom in the metrics → cause → fix, from articles 003–007.",
			"x": 660,
			"y": 64,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 152
		},
		{
			"id": "a3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "[[Article - future map]]\nOpen and stopped routes from the research maps, grouped.",
			"x": 660,
			"y": 246,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 124
		},
		{
			"id": "t6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 4 · [[Add guardrails]]\nPrompt injection in documents, access rules, personal data in answers; a small red-team set.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1264,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 140
		},
		{
			"id": "t8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 5 · [[Add observability and RAG quality tracking]]\nTraces per request, chat metrics (follow-ups, rephrasing, not-found rate), alerts.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1562,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 184
		},
		{
			"id": "t9",
			"type": "text",
			"color": "3",
			"width": 460,
			"height": 268,
			"x": 0,
			"y": 412,
			"text": "## 2 · [[Run the final evaluation]]\nOne card, checklist inside: drift fixes (ambiguity labels, memory notes v3, strict + lenient judge, citations) → free metrics (retrieval, agent effort, stage timing, refusals) → own RAGAS judge → off-topic set + refusal verdict → `ragas` sample → paid runs.\n**Done when:** both systems judged on the 500 + off-topic set, 2–3 repeats, report written."
		},
		{
			"id": "a4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "[[Private and personal data questions]]\nSalary, vacation, HR records: not in this dataset; how a real deployment refuses or routes them.",
			"x": 660,
			"y": 400,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 124
		}
	],
